{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's way harder than it looks. But just as weird.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to face the surreal challenge of controlling a disembodied arm called Derech\u00edn, using only the buttons and movement of your mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/1d24ed3096a14752fedae97344b6c404.poster.avif?t=1758684401\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/1d24ed3096a14752fedae97344b6c404.webm?t=1758684401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/1d24ed3096a14752fedae97344b6c404.mp4?t=1758684401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and physically interact with different types of objects and characters to complete the chapters of Derech\u00edn's extravagant story! And if you want, you can go back to them and try to complete them in the least amount of time you can possibly take! Do you have what it takes to reach the top of the leaderboard? (Yes, this is a desperate call to the speedrunner community)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/33b670fe8c5f89cffb4973f427f3ef07.poster.avif?t=1758684401\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/33b670fe8c5f89cffb4973f427f3ef07.webm?t=1758684401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/33b670fe8c5f89cffb4973f427f3ef07.mp4?t=1758684401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not THAT weird controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the default controls aren't quite as normal as some would like, they were designed this way for a very special reason: you should be able to control every finger using the same finger in real life, and also be able to extend and contract the arm doing the same with yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/3ec96c4caee5c861692f7835a1acc4aa.poster.avif?t=1758684401\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/3ec96c4caee5c861692f7835a1acc4aa.webm?t=1758684401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/3ec96c4caee5c861692f7835a1acc4aa.mp4?t=1758684401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take the least amount of time possible!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the &quot;not quite normal people&quot; crowd, Arm Around! has a built-in online leader board system which keeps track of every record on every chapter. Best your friend's time to show off or even get to the top of the world-wide leader board to earn a well deserved (and very exclusive) achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/8233e568f1c311c53c319ea5e0cd9a4f.poster.avif?t=1758684401\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/8233e568f1c311c53c319ea5e0cd9a4f.webm?t=1758684401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/8233e568f1c311c53c319ea5e0cd9a4f.mp4?t=1758684401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long live the arm!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072400?t=1758684401","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758684401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758684401","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758684401","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's way harder than it looks. But just as weird.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to face the surreal challenge of controlling a disembodied arm called Derech\u00edn, using only the buttons and movement of your mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/1d24ed3096a14752fedae97344b6c404.poster.avif?t=1758684401\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/1d24ed3096a14752fedae97344b6c404.webm?t=1758684401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/1d24ed3096a14752fedae97344b6c404.mp4?t=1758684401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and physically interact with different 