044d1872ad38198c15617f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758684401","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/ss_35983feb5c2f967578044d1872ad38198c15617f.600x338.jpg?t=1758684401"}],"short_description":"You are an arm. Yes, seriously, just a disembodied arm. And to be it you have to use your mouse. Oh, and everything is physics based. If it sounds hard it's because it is. Drag, jump, punch and arm around to... wait, what kind of a mission could a disembodied arm possibly have?","steam_appid":3072400,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"www.ramcandy.com"},"supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}